# Secrets. `COPY . .` will otherwise bake a developer's real SECRET_KEY and
# database password into an image layer, where they survive in the history even
# if a later step deletes the file — and travel to anyone who can pull it.
# Configuration reaches the container through env_file at run time, never
# through the build. Observed: an image built here contained a full .env.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
